WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.555
Rabbit watched Henry drive Car.

2
00:00:09.556 --> 00:00:13.174
"Vroom, vroom!" Henry said.

3
00:00:13.175 --> 00:00:16.843
"Vroom, vroom!" Car said.

4
00:00:16.844 --> 00:00:20.533
Rabbit loved watching Car zoom around.

5
00:00:20.534 --> 00:00:23.830
But he wanted to play with Henry too.

6
00:00:23.831 --> 00:00:25.832
He waited and waited.

7
00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:32.636
"My turn will come soon," Rabbit thought.

8
00:00:32.637 --> 00:00:36.003
Car drove backward and forward.

9
00:00:36.004 --> 00:00:39.221
She shot under a chair.

10
00:00:39.222 --> 00:00:42.884
She went around a tower made of blocks.

11
00:00:42.885 --> 00:00:49.248
Henry grinned. "This car is so fast!"

12
00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:51.310
Then . . . crash!

13
00:00:51.311 --> 00:00:54.518
Car slammed hard into the tower.

14
00:00:54.519 --> 00:00:58.481
Wooden blocks tumbled down onto Car.

15
00:00:58.482 --> 00:01:02.254
"Oh no!" Henry cried.

16
00:01:02.255 --> 00:01:05.592
Dad ran into the playroom.

17
00:01:05.593 --> 00:01:08.766
"What happened? Are you okay?"

18
00:01:08.767 --> 00:01:15.144
"I'm okay," Henry said. "But my car isn't!"

19
00:01:15.145 --> 00:01:17.986
Car's front bumper had a crack.

20
00:01:17.987 --> 00:01:22.168
The antenna was bent.

21
00:01:22.169 --> 00:01:30.719
"Let's see if we can fix it," Dad said.

22
00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:35.807
Rabbit watched while Dad taped the bumper.

23
00:01:35.808 --> 00:01:44.228
Dad spent a long time working.

24
00:01:44.229 --> 00:01:52.652
At last Henry picked up the control again.

25
00:01:52.653 --> 00:01:57.678
The car made a sound but didn't move.

26
00:01:57.679 --> 00:02:01.052
Henry started to cry.

27
00:02:01.053 --> 00:02:04.758
Dad hugged him. "Sorry, Henry.

28
00:02:04.759 --> 00:02:14.524
We tried to fix it, but it's broken."

29
00:02:14.525 --> 00:02:19.340
Dad took Car away.

30
00:02:19.341 --> 00:02:23.590
"Uh-oh," Rabbit thought, looking down.

31
00:02:23.591 --> 00:02:26.292
Rabbit's coat looked a little shabby.

32
00:02:26.293 --> 00:02:28.531
Some threads were loose.

33
00:02:28.532 --> 00:02:30.824
Rabbit gulped.

34
00:02:30.825 --> 00:02:37.188
"One day Dad might take me away too!"

